# Practical 11: Create Multiple Files

## Objective

Automate file creation.

### Script

```bash
#!/bin/bash

for i in {1..5}
do
    touch file$i.txt
done

echo "Files Created Successfully"
```

### Verify

```bash
ls
```

### Result

```text
file1.txt
file2.txt
file3.txt
file4.txt
file5.txt
```



